SECTION 8. Filing with County. The City Clerk shall, not later than the 88th day prior to the
General Municipal Election to be held on Tuesday, November 3, 2026, file with the Board of Supervisors
and the County Clerk – Registrar of Voters of the County of San Bernardino, State of California, a
